{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1320327001:1":{"text":"레프스키, 좋은 소식이 있어요!","source_cn":"列夫斯基，有个好消息要告诉你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C23DD5A0816F35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320327002:1":{"text":"우리 친구가 망가진 그림을 복원해 주기로 했어요. 복원이 끝나면 돌려준대요!","source_cn":"我们的朋友决定帮你修复那副被损坏的画，等恢复原样后就会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF6DCF57A5C5D51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320327003:1":{"text":"그... 그게 정말인가요? 듀라 님이시여... 콜록, 콜록!","source_cn":"这……这是真的吗？！艾雅在上……咳、咳咳——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85D4A5069494FB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320327004:1":{"text":"지, 진정해요! 심신의 안정이 가장 중요하다고요!","source_cn":"别——别激动！你要尽量保持心情平和才行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x449AB50AA49AFBF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320327005:1":{"text":"하, 하하... 너무 기뻐서 그래요. 죄, 죄송합니다... 콜록...","source_cn":"哈、哈哈……我只是太高兴了，抱歉……咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A51D90DAADCBB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1320327005":{"text":"하, 하하... 너무 기뻐서 그래요. 죄, 죄송합니다... 콜록...","source_cn":"哈、哈哈……我只是太高兴了，抱歉……咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56A51D90DAADCBB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320327006:1":{"text":"기쁜 마음은 알겠지만 건강이 제일 중요하잖아요! 아니면 제가 몸 상태를 한 번 더 확인해 볼게요.","source_cn":"我能理解你的心情，但还是保重身体最要紧！不如，我再来帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x444F86C0ECEDB8B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320327007:1":{"text":"부탁드릴게요... 사실, 더는 의사를 부를 여유도 없거든요. 콜록...","source_cn":"那就麻烦了……实不相瞒，我已经快要看不起医生了，咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE69855A20B9D1915","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320327008:1":{"text":"...! ","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320327009:1":{"text":"어, 어때요? 제가 그림이 완성될 때까지 버틸 수 있을까요...","source_cn":"怎、怎么样？我的身体，能坚持到那幅画修好的时候吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7311737E0C7E183C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320327010:1":{"text":"...걱정 마세요... 큰 문제는 없어요. 잘 쉬고 제때 약을 먹으면... 분명 나을 거예요.","source_cn":"……放心吧……没什么大问题。只要你好好休息，按时吃药…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566308762A697BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320327011:1":{"text":"다행이네요... 그럼 저는 조금 더, 자야겠어요... 콜록...","source_cn":"那就好……我、我得再睡一觉……咳……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25EC1899E67CD1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320327012:1":{"text":"해미... 표정이 왜 그래? 설마 레프스키 씨의 몸 상태가...?","source_cn":"漫漫……你的表情好凝重。是不是列夫斯基的身体……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5965EF82DA449303","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1320327012":{"text":"해미... 표정이 왜 그래? 설마 레프스키 씨의 몸 상태가...?","source_cn":"漫漫……你的表情好凝重。是不是列夫斯基的身体……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5965EF82DA449303","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320327013:1":{"text":"...네.","source_cn":"……嗯。<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F054EB5BB68D117","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320327015:1":{"text":"병이 뼛속 깊이 스며든 상태라 어떤 약도 듣지 않아서, 언제든 죽어도 이상하지 않아요...","source_cn":"他的病已经深入骨髓，任何药都没用，随时可能死去……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F11853198DF1CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320327016:1":{"text":"긍정적인 마음을 유지하기를 바라는 수밖에요. 그래야 조금이라도 버틸 수 있으니까요...","source_cn":"现在只能寄希望于他能保持乐观的心态，或许能再多坚持一阵……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89C483D51339CA39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320327017:1":{"text":"그럼... 여기서 기다리는 것보다 <style=\"highlight\">세레니티 장원</style>으로 돌아가서 루보미르를 재촉해봐요!","source_cn":"那……那我们别干等着了，赶快回<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C72904026EC2632","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"이미 손쓸 수 없는 상태구나","source_cn":"他已经病入膏肓了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69C4AEBB6AD6965C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이미 손쓸 수 없는 상태구나","female":"이미 손쓸 수 없는 상태구나","variant_male_record_index":"68474","variant_female_record_index":"68475","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320327014:1":{"text":"모, 모르겠어요...","source_cn":"我、我不知道……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CE84B8B5EF2E618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"그래도 버텨낼 수 있겠지?","sou